### Secrets ###
# Read automatically by docker-compose - must never be committed.
/.env
.env.local
# Documented template without values stays under version control.
!.env.example
 
### IntelliJ IDEA ###
.idea
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr
 
### VS Code ###
# Never exclude the directory itself: Git would not descend into it, and then
# no exception anywhere could bring a file back.
**/.vscode/*
!**/.vscode/settings.json
!**/.vscode/extensions.json
 
### STS / Eclipse ###
.apt_generated
.classpath
.factorypath
.project
.settings
.springBeans
.sts4-cache
 
### OS ###
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
